{"id": "fDjE52bQTtE1", "owner": "showcase", "title": "Glitch Punks — 10,000 corrupted citizens on-chain", "createdAt": 1790349389616, "updatedAt": 1790349600257, "versions": [{"prompt": "NFT collection page \"Glitch Punks\" — grid of 12 unique pixel-art character avatars drawn in SVG with glitch effects, rarity filters, mint panel with progress bar. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Glitch Punks — 10,000 corrupted citizens on-chain</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#0b0605;\n  --bg-2:#120a07;\n  --ink:#efdad6;\n  --dim:#8b766f;\n  --green:#ff14ae;\n  --blue:#ffdb5b;\n  --line:rgba(255,20,174,.16);\n  --line-b:rgba(255,219,91,.18);\n  --mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;\n  --grot:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{max-width:100%;overflow-x:hidden}\nbody{\n  margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--grot);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\n/* pixel grid + scanline texture */\nbody::before{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(255,20,174,.045) 1px,transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,219,91,.035) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:36px 36px;\n  mask-image:radial-gradient(120% 80% at 50% 0%,#000000 30%,rgba(0,0,0,.35) 100%);\n}\nbody::after{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;pointer-events:none;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,0,0,0) 0 2px,rgba(0,0,0,.22) 2px 4px);\n  mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.75;\n}\n.wrap{max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;position:relative;z-index:2}\na{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\n.mono{font-family:var(--mono)}\n\n/* ---------- header ---------- */\nheader{\n  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,6,5,.94),rgba(11,6,5,.6));\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\n}\n.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;height:68px}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-size:17px}\n.brand .mk{width:28px;height:28px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(255,20,174,.6))}\n.nav nav{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.nav nav a{transition:color .2s,text-shadow .2s}\n.nav nav a:hover{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(255,20,174,.7)}\n.btn{\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  padding:11px 18px;border:1px solid var(--green);color:var(--green);background:transparent;\n  cursor:pointer;position:relative;transition:.2s;\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 rgba(255,20,174,0), inset 0 0 22px rgba(255,20,174,.06);\n}\n.btn:hover{background:rgba(255,20,174,.1);box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(255,20,174,.35), inset 0 0 22px rgba(255,20,174,.12)}\n.btn.blue{border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--blue)}\n.btn.blue:hover{background:rgba(255,219,91,.1);box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(255,219,91,.3)}\n.btn.solid{background:var(--green);color:#170306;font-weight:700;border-color:var(--green)}\n.btn.solid:hover{background:#ff3cbc;box-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(255,20,174,.55)}\n\n/* ---------- hero ---------- */\n.hero{min-height:calc(100svh - 68px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;padding:56px 0 48px;position:relative}\n.hero::before{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;width:620px;height:620px;left:-240px;top:-80px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,20,174,.12),transparent 65%);filter:blur(20px);pointer-events:none\n}\n.hero::after{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;width:560px;height:560px;right:-180px;bottom:-140px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,219,91,.13),transparent 65%);filter:blur(20px);pointer-events:none\n}\n.tag{\n  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;\n  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);border:1px solid var(--line-b);padding:7px 12px;background:rgba(255,219,91,.05)\n}\n.dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);animation:blip 1.2s steps(2) infinite}\n@keyframes blip{50%{opacity:.25}}\nh1{\n  font-size:clamp(52px,7.4vw,116px);line-height:.86;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:26px 0 0;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\n}\n.glitch{position:relative;display:block;color:#ffeaec}\n.glitch span{display:block}\n.glitch::before,.glitch::after{\n  content:attr(data-t);position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;\n}\n.glitch::before{color:var(--green);clip-path:inset(0 0 68% 0);animation:gx 3.6s infinite steps(1);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,20,174,.5)}\n.glitch::after{color:var(--blue);clip-path:inset(72% 0 0 0);animation:gy 4.2s infinite steps(1);text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,219,91,.5)}\n@keyframes gx{0%,88%{transform:translate(0);opacity:0}89%{transform:translate(-7px,-2px);opacity:.95}92%{transform:translate(5px,2px);opacity:.9}95%{transform:translate(-3px,0);opacity:.8}97%,100%{opacity:0}}\n@keyframes gy{0%,80%{transform:translate(0);opacity:0}82%{transform:translate(6px,3px);opacity:.9}86%{transform:translate(-5px,-3px);opacity:.85}90%{opacity:0}100%{opacity:0}}\n.lede{max-width:46ch;margin:26px 0 0;color:#bda59f;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6}\n.hero-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:34px;align-items:center}\n.hero-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:44px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.hero-stats div{background:var(--bg);padding:16px 14px}\n.hero-stats b{display:block;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.hero-stats .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-top:5px}\n\n/* hero art */\n.stage{position:relative;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center}\n.frame{\n  position:relative;width:min(100%,430px);aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid var(--line);\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(90% 80% at 50% 10%,rgba(255,20,174,.1),transparent 60%),\n    linear-gradient(160deg,#140908,#100804);\n  box-shadow:0 0 70px rgba(255,20,174,.14), inset 0 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6);\n  padding:26px;\n}\n.frame .corner{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid var(--green);opacity:.8}\n.frame .c1{top:-1px;left:-1px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0}\n.frame .c2{top:-1px;right:-1px;border-left:0;border-bottom:0}\n.frame .c3{bottom:-1px;left:-1px;border-right:0;border-top:0}\n.frame .c4{bottom:-1px;right:-1px;border-left:0;border-top:0}\n.frame .label{\n  position:absolute;bottom:-1px;left:-1px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;\n  color:#170306;background:var(--green);padding:5px 10px;text-transform:uppercase\n}\n.art{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;isolation:isolate}\n.art .layer{position:absolute;inset:0}\n.art svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated}\n.art .gr,.art .bl{opacity:0;mix-blend-mode:screen}\n.art.live .gr{animation:sl1 4s infinite steps(1);opacity:1}\n.art.live .bl{animation:sl2 5.5s infinite steps(1);opacity:1}\n@keyframes sl1{\n  0%,70%{clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0);transform:translate(0)}\n  72%{clip-path:inset(22% 0 62% 0);transform:translate(-6px,0);opacity:.75}\n  76%{clip-path:inset(55% 0 30% 0);transform:translate(5px,0);opacity:.6}\n  80%{clip-path:inset(8% 0 80% 0);transform:translate(-3px,0);opacity:.7}\n  84%,100%{clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0)}\n}\n@keyframes sl2{\n  0%,55%{clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0);transform:translate(0)}\n  58%{clip-path:inset(40% 0 44% 0);transform:translate(7px,-2px);opacity:.7}\n  62%{clip-path:inset(70% 0 18% 0);transform:translate(-6px,2px);opacity:.55}\n  67%,100%{clip-path:inset(100% 0 0 0)}\n}\n.chips{position:absolute;inset:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;right:-6px;top:6%}\n.chip{\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;\n  border:1px solid var(--line-b);background:rgba(11,6,5,.85);padding:7px 10px;color:var(--blue)\n}\n.chip b{color:var(--green);font-weight:500}\n\n/* ---------- section head ---------- */\n.sec{padding:96px 0 0;position:relative;z-index:2}\n.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:22px}\n.sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.4vw,46px);margin:0;letter-spacing:-.035em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.95}\n.sec-head p{margin:0 0 4px auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n\n/* ---------- layout: grid + mint ---------- */\n.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 372px;gap:40px;align-items:start;margin-top:32px;padding-bottom:110px}\n.filters{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:26px}\n.f{\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:9px 14px;\n  border:1px solid rgba(239,218,214,.16);color:var(--dim);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s\n}\n.f:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:rgba(239,218,214,.4)}\n.f .n{opacity:.55;margin-left:7px}\n.f[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:#170306;background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(255,20,174,.35)}\n.f[aria-pressed=\"true\"] .n{opacity:.7}\n\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}\n.card{\n  border:1px solid rgba(239,218,214,.1);background:linear-gradient(170deg,#130908,#0d0705);\n  padding:12px;position:relative;transition:transform .25s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.3,1),border-color .25s,box-shadow .25s;\n}\n.card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.6),0 0 26px rgba(255,20,174,.2)}\n.card .thumb{\n  position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;background:\n    radial-gradient(80% 70% at 50% 18%,rgba(255,219,91,.1),transparent 62%),\n    linear-gradient(180deg,#170e0a,#110b06);\n  border:1px solid rgba(239,218,214,.07);padding:14px;overflow:hidden\n}\n.card:hover .gr,.card:hover .bl{opacity:1}\n.card:hover .gr{animation:hv1 .55s steps(1) infinite}\n.card:hover .bl{animation:hv2 .7s steps(1) infinite}\n@keyframes hv1{0%{clip-path:inset(18% 0 66% 0);transform:translateX(-5px);opacity:.7}50%{clip-path:inset(58% 0 26% 0);transform:translateX(4px);opacity:.55}100%{clip-path:inset(80% 0 6% 0);transform:translateX(-2px);opacity:.6}}\n@keyframes hv2{0%{clip-path:inset(40% 0 44% 0);transform:translateX(5px);opacity:.6}50%{clip-path:inset(8% 0 78% 0);transform:translateX(-5px);opacity:.5}100%{clip-path:inset(66% 0 20% 0);transform:translateX(3px);opacity:.55}}\n.rar{\n  position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;\n  text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 8px;border:1px solid currentColor\n}\n.r-common{color:#a3908a}\n.r-rare{color:var(--blue);background:rgba(255,219,91,.08)}\n.r-epic{color:var(--green);background:rgba(255,20,174,.08)}\n.r-legendary{color:#170306;background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);font-weight:700}\n.r-glitched{color:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);background:rgba(255,219,91,.14);animation:blip 1s steps(2) infinite}\n.card h3{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.02em;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px}\n.card h3 .id{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.06em}\n.card .traits{margin:8px 0 0;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.6}\n.card .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(239,218,214,.12);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px}\n.card .row .price{color:var(--green)}\n.card[hidden]{display:none}\n\n/* ---------- mint panel ---------- */\n.mint{position:sticky;top:96px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#140908,#0c0604);padding:24px;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(255,20,174,.08), inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}\n.mint h3{margin:0;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.mint .sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);margin:8px 0 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}\n.bar{height:16px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(255,20,174,.05);position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:3px}\n.bar i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green) 0 8px,rgba(255,20,174,.55) 8px 12px);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(255,20,174,.6);transition:width 1.6s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n.bar-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;margin-top:9px;color:var(--dim)}\n.bar-meta b{color:var(--ink)}\n.mintgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:rgba(239,218,214,.1);border:1px solid rgba(239,218,214,.1);margin:22px 0}\n.mintgrid div{background:#110b06;padding:13px 14px}\n.mintgrid .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.mintgrid .v{font-size:17px;margin-top:5px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.qty{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:14px}\n.qty button{width:34px;height:34px;border:1px solid rgba(255,20,174,.35);background:transparent;color:var(--green);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:17px;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s}\n.qty button:hover{background:rgba(255,20,174,.12);box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(255,20,174,.3)}\n.qty .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:22px;letter-spacing:.1em}\n.qty .lab{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n.total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:16px}\n.total b{color:var(--green);font-size:14px}\n.mint .btn.solid{width:100%;padding:16px;font-size:13px}\n.note{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.7;margin:14px 0 0;text-align:center}\n.feed{margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(239,218,214,.1);padding-top:14px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--dim);display:grid;gap:7px}\n.feed span{color:var(--blue)}\n.feed b{color:var(--green);font-weight:500}\n\n/* ---------- footer ---------- */\nfooter{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0 54px;position:relative;z-index:2}\n.foot{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;align-items:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.foot .sp{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:22px}\n.foot a:hover{color:var(--green)}\n\n@media (max-width:1180px){\n  .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}\n}\n@media (max-width:980px){\n  .wrap{padding:0 24px}\n  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto;padding:44px 0 56px;gap:44px}\n  .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .mint{position:static;order:-1}\n  .chips{position:static;flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:18px}\n  .nav nav{display:none}\n}\n@media (max-width:640px){\n  .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}\n  .hero-stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n  .wrap{padding:0 16px}\n  .card{padding:9px}\n  .card .traits{display:none}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#ff4fd8;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Anton\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"nft\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/comfyui.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"trc-s\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/dyad.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>G</i>Glitch Punks</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Collection</a><a href=\"#\">Rarity</a><a href=\"#\">Roadmap</a><a href=\"#\">Mint</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Mint now</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>NFT collection · Robinhood Chain</span><h1>Glitch <em>Punks</em></h1><p>10,000 corrupted citizens. Every one of them glitched differently.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Mint now</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  <div class=\"trc-dots\"><i class=on></i><i></i><span>01 / 02</span></div>\n</section>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('[data-trc]'),s=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-s'),d=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-dots i'),n=r.querySelector('.trc-dots span'),k=0;\nfunction go(i){k=i%s.length;s.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});d.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});if(n)n.textContent='0'+(k+1)+' / 0'+s.length}\nvar h=/#s(\\d)/.exec(location.hash);if(h)go(+h[1]-1);else if(s.length>1)setInterval(function(){go(k+1)},5200);}());</script>\n<!--/tr-cover-->\n\n\n\n\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap nav\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <svg class=\"mk\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" shape-rendering=\"crispEdges\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <rect x=\"3\" y=\"2\" width=\"10\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#ff14ae\"/>\n        <rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#1a100d\"/>\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"3\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#ff14ae\"/>\n        <rect x=\"9\" y=\"6\" width=\"3\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#ffdb5b\"/>\n        <rect x=\"5\" y=\"9\" width=\"6\" height=\"1\" fill=\"#ff14ae\"/>\n        <rect x=\"4\" y=\"12\" width=\"8\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#ffdb5b\"/>\n      </svg>\n      GLITCH&nbsp;PUNKS\n    </div>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#collection\">Collection</a>\n      <a href=\"#mint\">Mint</a>\n      <a href=\"#traits\">Traits</a>\n      <a href=\"#roadmap\">Protocol</a>\n    </nav>\n    <button class=\"btn blue\" id=\"connect\">Connect Wallet</button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n<section class=\"wrap hero\">\n  <div>\n    <span class=\"tag\"><i class=\"dot\"></i> Mint live · Block 19,842,117</span>\n    <h1 class=\"glitch\" data-t=\"GLITCH PUNKS\"><span>Glitch<br>Punks</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">10,000 corrupted citizens rendered pixel by pixel, fully on-chain. Every punk is a 16×16 SVG artifact — no servers, no IPFS, no decay. Signal degradation included by design.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-cta\">\n      <a class=\"btn solid\" href=\"#mint\">Mint a punk · 0.08 ETH</a>\n      <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#collection\">Browse collection</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hero-stats\">\n      <div><b id=\"heroMinted\">6,842</b><span class=\"k\">Minted</span></div>\n      <div><b>0.08</b><span class=\"k\">Mint price Ξ</span></div>\n      <div><b>2,914</b><span class=\"k\">Holders</span></div>\n      <div><b>0.21</b><span class=\"k\">Floor Ξ</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stage\">\n    <div class=\"frame\">\n      <i class=\"corner c1\"></i><i class=\"corner c2\"></i><i class=\"corner c3\"></i><i class=\"corner c4\"></i>\n      <div class=\"art live\" id=\"heroArt\"></div>\n      <span class=\"label\">PUNK #0001 · LEGENDARY</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"chips\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">RENDER <b>SVG / 16×16</b></span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">CHAIN <b>ETHEREUM L1</b></span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">TRAITS <b>184 ATTR.</b></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"wrap sec\" id=\"collection\">\n  <div class=\"sec-head\">\n    <h2>The Feed —<br>12 uncovered punks</h2>\n    <p>Filter by rarity tier</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cols\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"filters\" id=\"filters\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Rarity filters\">\n        <button class=\"f\" data-f=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All <span class=\"n\">12</span></button>\n        <button class=\"f\" data-f=\"common\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Common <span class=\"n\">4</span></button>\n        <button class=\"f\" data-f=\"rare\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Rare <span class=\"n\">3</span></button>\n        <button class=\"f\" data-f=\"epic\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Epic <span class=\"n\">3</span></button>\n        <button class=\"f\" data-f=\"legendary\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Legendary <span class=\"n\">1</span></button>\n        <button class=\"f\" data-f=\"glitched\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Glitched <span class=\"n\">1</span></button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"mint\" id=\"mint\">\n      <h3>Mint terminal</h3>\n      <p class=\"sub\"><i class=\"dot\"></i> Public phase · open</p>\n\n      <div class=\"bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"10000\" aria-valuenow=\"6842\" aria-label=\"Mint progress\"><i id=\"fill\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"bar-meta\"><span><b id=\"mintedNum\">6,842</b> / 10,000</span><span id=\"pct\">68.42%</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"mintgrid\">\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Price</div><div class=\"v\">0.08 Ξ</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Max / wallet</div><div class=\"v\">10</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Network</div><div class=\"v\">Ethereum</div></div>\n        <div><div class=\"k\">Gas est.</div><div class=\"v\">0.0031 Ξ</div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"qty\">\n        <button id=\"minus\" aria-label=\"Decrease quantity\">–</button>\n        <div style=\"text-align:center\"><div class=\"num\" id=\"qty\">3</div><div class=\"lab\">quantity</div></div>\n        <button id=\"plus\" aria-label=\"Increase quantity\">+</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"total\"><span>TOTAL INCL. GAS</span><b id=\"total\">0.2431 Ξ</b></div>\n      <button class=\"btn solid\" id=\"mintBtn\">Mint 3 punks</button>\n      <p class=\"note\">Each mint writes a unique 16×16 SVG artifact directly to the contract. Reveal is instant — corruption is permanent.</p>\n\n      <div class=\"feed\" id=\"liveFeed\">\n        <div><span>0x7f..a2c1</span> minted <b>2 punks</b> · 14s ago</div>\n        <div><span>void.eth</span> minted <b>1 punk</b> · 48s ago</div>\n        <div><span>0x91..07de</span> minted <b>5 punks</b> · 1m ago</div>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"wrap sec\" id=\"traits\" style=\"padding-bottom:96px\">\n  <div class=\"sec-head\">\n    <h2>Trait registry</h2>\n    <p>184 attributes · 6 categories</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-stats\" style=\"margin-top:28px;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr)\">\n    <div><b>7</b><span class=\"k\">Head</span></div>\n    <div><b>6</b><span class=\"k\">Optics</span></div>\n    <div><b>6</b><span class=\"k\">Mouth</span></div>\n    <div><b>6</b><span class=\"k\">Gear</span></div>\n    <div><b>5</b><span class=\"k\">Skin</span></div>\n    <div><b>2</b><span class=\"k\">Signal</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\n<footer id=\"roadmap\">\n  <div class=\"wrap foot\">\n    <span>© 2049 Glitch Punks Protocol</span>\n    <span class=\"sp\">\n      <a href=\"#collection\">Contract 0x6b…d4f2</a>\n      <a href=\"#mint\">Terms</a>\n      <a href=\"#collection\">Signal log</a>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n<script>\n/* ---------------- pixel punk generator ---------------- */\nconst SKIN   = ['#40332f','#52413c','#705e57','#cdbeb9','#94847f'];\nconst SHADE  = ['#2b211e','#352828','#4d3f3b','#a3918b','#6e605b'];\nconst DARK   = '#120b08';\nconst NEON   = ['#ff14ae','#ffdb5b'];\n\nconst HAIR  = ['Mohawk','Signal Cap','Static Spikes','Chrome Dome','Wire Fall','Node Braids','Top Knot'];\nconst EYES  = ['Neon Stare','Scan Visor','Cyclops Lens','Null Shades','X-Fault','Wide Sync'];\nconst MOUTH = ['Smirk','Data Grill','Ash Stick','Flatline','Fangs','Vox Mask'];\nconst GEAR  = ['None','Ion Earring','Antenna','Headset','Face Scar','Neck Chip'];\n\nfunction blank(){ return Array.from({length:16},()=>Array(16).fill(null)); }\nfunction px(g,x,y,c){ if(x>=0&&x<16&&y>=0&&y<16) g[y][x]=c; }\nfunction box(g,x0,y0,x1,y1,c){ for(let y=y0;y<=y1;y++) for(let x=x0;x<=x1;x++) px(g,x,y,c); }\n\nfunction buildPunk(cfg){\n  const g = blank();\n  const skin = SKIN[cfg.sk], shade = SHADE[cfg.sk];\n  const neon = NEON[cfg.n], alt = NEON[1-cfg.n];\n\n  /* head */\n  box(g,4,4,11,13,skin);\n  for(let y=4;y<=13;y++) px(g,11,y,shade);\n  box(g,4,13,11,13,shade);\n  /* neck + jacket */\n  box(g,6,14,9,14,shade);\n  box(g,3,15,12,15,'#1c1310');\n  px(g,5,15,neon); px(g,10,15,neon);\n\n  /* hair / head gear */\n  switch(cfg.h){\n    case 0: box(g,7,0,8,3,neon); px(g,6,3,neon); px(g,9,3,neon); px(g,7,0,alt); break;\n    case 1: box(g,4,2,11,3,neon); box(g,3,4,12,4,DARK); px(g,4,2,alt); break;\n    case 2: box(g,4,3,11,3,neon); px(g,4,2,neon); px(g,6,2,neon); px(g,8,2,neon); px(g,10,2,neon); px(g,6,1,alt); break;\n    case 3: box(g,4,3,11,3,shade); px(g,7,3,neon); break;\n    case 4: box(g,4,2,11,3,neon); for(let y=4;y<=11;y++){ px(g,3,y,neon); px(g,12,y,neon);} break;\n    case 5: box(g,4,3,11,3,neon); px(g,4,2,neon); px(g,7,2,neon); px(g,10,2,neon); px(g,3,5,alt); px(g,12,5,alt); px(g,3,7,alt); px(g,12,7,alt); break;\n    case 6: box(g,4,3,11,3,neon); box(g,7,0,8,2,neon); px(g,7,0,alt); px(g,8,0,alt); break;\n  }\n\n  /* eyes */\n  switch(cfg.e){\n    case 0: px(g,5,7,DARK); px(g,6,7,neon); px(g,9,7,neon); px(g,10,7,DARK); break;\n    case 1: box(g,3,6,12,7,DARK); box(g,4,7,11,7,alt); px(g,5,6,alt); break;\n    case 2: box(g,6,6,9,8,DARK); box(g,7,7,8,7,neon); break;\n    case 3: box(g,4,6,11,7,DARK); px(g,5,6,alt); px(g,10,7,alt); break;\n    case 4: px(g,5,6,neon); px(g,6,7,neon); px(g,6,6,DARK); px(g,5,7,DARK);\n            px(g,9,6,neon); px(g,10,7,neon); px(g,10,6,DARK); px(g,9,7,DARK); break;\n    case 5: box(g,5,6,6,7,'#f6e9e6'); box(g,9,6,10,7,'#f6e9e6'); px(g,6,7,DARK); px(g,9,7,DARK); px(g,5,6,alt); break;\n  }\n\n  /* mouth */\n  switch(cfg.m){\n    case 0: box(g,6,10,8,10,DARK); px(g,9,9,DARK); break;\n    case 1: box(g,6,10,9,10,neon); px(g,7,11,DARK); break;\n    case 2: box(g,6,10,7,10,DARK); box(g,9,10,11,10,'#eee3df'); px(g,12,10,neon); px(g,12,8,'#3a2f2b'); px(g,13,7,'#302522'); break;\n    case 3: box(g,6,10,9,10,DARK); break;\n    case 4: box(g,6,10,9,10,DARK); px(g,6,11,'#f6e9e6'); px(g,9,11,'#f6e9e6'); break;\n    case 5: box(g,5,9,10,12,'#211614'); box(g,6,10,9,10,alt); px(g,7,11,neon); px(g,8,11,neon); break;\n  }\n\n  /* gear */\n  switch(cfg.g){\n    case 1: px(g,12,9,neon); px(g,12,10,alt); break;\n    case 2: px(g,8,0,neon); px(g,8,1,shade); px(g,8,2,shade); break;\n    case 3: box(g,3,5,3,8,alt); box(g,12,5,12,8,alt); box(g,4,2,11,2,alt); break;\n    case 4: box(g,5,4,5,8,neon); break;\n    case 5: px(g,9,14,neon); px(g,8,14,alt); break;\n  }\n  return g;\n}\n\nfunction toSVG(g, flat){\n  let r='';\n  for(let y=0;y<16;y++){\n    let x=0;\n    while(x<16){\n      const c=g[y][x];\n      if(!c){x++;continue;}\n      let w=1;\n      while(x+w<16 && g[y][x+w]===c) w++;\n      r+=`<rect x=\"${x}\" y=\"${y}\" width=\"${w}\" height=\"1\" fill=\"${flat||c}\"/>`;\n      x+=w;\n    }\n  }\n  return `<svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" shape-rendering=\"crispEdges\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\">${r}</svg>`;\n}\n\nfunction artHTML(g){\n  return `<div class=\"layer base\">${toSVG(g)}</div>\n          <div class=\"layer gr\">${toSVG(g,'#ff14ae')}</div>\n          <div class=\"layer bl\">${toSVG(g,'#ffdb5b')}</div>`;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- collection data ---------------- */\nconst PUNKS = [\n  {id:'0001', name:'Null Sovereign',  sk:3, n:0, h:0, e:1, m:1, g:2, tier:'legendary', price:'12.40'},\n  {id:'0187', name:'Static Priest',   sk:1, n:1, h:2, e:4, m:4, g:4, tier:'glitched',  price:'6.80'},\n  {id:'0492', name:'Vox Dealer',      sk:0, n:0, h:1, e:3, m:5, g:3, tier:'epic',      price:'2.95'},\n  {id:'0733', name:'Signal Widow',    sk:4, n:1, h:4, e:5, m:0, g:1, tier:'epic',      price:'2.40'},\n  {id:'1044', name:'Ash Runner',      sk:2, n:0, h:3, e:0, m:2, g:5, tier:'epic',      price:'1.98'},\n  {id:'1520', name:'Node Oracle',     sk:3, n:1, h:5, e:2, m:3, g:0, tier:'rare',      price:'0.94'},\n  {id:'2201', name:'Deck Kid',        sk:1, n:0, h:6, e:5, m:0, g:3, tier:'rare',      price:'0.77'},\n  {id:'2876', name:'Flicker',         sk:0, n:1, h:2, e:1, m:3, g:1, tier:'rare',      price:'0.69'},\n  {id:'3390', name:'Grey Packet',     sk:4, n:0, h:3, e:0, m:3, g:0, tier:'common',    price:'0.24'},\n  {id:'4118', name:'Low Bandwidth',   sk:2, n:1, h:1, e:5, m:0, g:0, tier:'common',    price:'0.22'},\n  {id:'5002', name:'Corner Ghost',    sk:0, n:0, h:4, e:3, m:4, g:5, tier:'common',    price:'0.21'},\n  {id:'6841', name:'Last Uplink',     sk:1, n:1, h:6, e:4, m:2, g:4, tier:'common',    price:'0.21'}\n];\n\n/* hero art */\ndocument.getElementById('heroArt').innerHTML = artHTML(buildPunk(PUNKS[0]));\n\n/* grid */\nconst grid = document.getElementById('grid');\ngrid.innerHTML = PUNKS.map(p=>{\n  const g = buildPunk(p);\n  const live = p.tier==='glitched' ? ' live' : '';\n  return `<article class=\"card\" data-tier=\"${p.tier}\">\n    <div class=\"thumb\">\n      <span class=\"rar r-${p.tier}\">${p.tier}</span>\n      <div class=\"art${live}\">${artHTML(g)}</div>\n    </div>\n    <h3>${p.name} <span class=\"id\">#${p.id}</span></h3>\n    <p class=\"traits\">${HAIR[p.h]} · ${EYES[p.e]}<br>${MOUTH[p.m]} · ${GEAR[p.g]}</p>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"price\">${p.price} Ξ</span><span>rank ${String(Math.round((1-parseFloat(p.price)/13)*9800)+12).padStart(4,'0')}</span></div>\n  </article>`;\n}).join('');\n\n/* filters */\nconst filters = document.getElementById('filters');\nfilters.addEventListener('click', e=>{\n  const b = e.target.closest('.f'); if(!b) return;\n  [...filters.children].forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(x===b)));\n  const f = b.dataset.f;\n  grid.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(c=>{\n    c.hidden = !(f==='all' || c.dataset.tier===f);\n  });\n});\n\n/* mint panel */\nconst MINTED = 6842, SUPPLY = 10000, PRICE = 0.08, GAS = 0.0031;\nlet qty = 3, minted = MINTED;\n\nfunction renderMint(){\n  const pct = (minted/SUPPLY*100);\n  document.getElementById('fill').style.width = pct.toFixed(2)+'%';\n  document.getElementById('pct').textContent = pct.toFixed(2)+'%';\n  document.getElementById('mintedNum').textContent = minted.toLocaleString('en-US');\n  document.getElementById('heroMinted').textContent = minted.toLocaleString('en-US');\n  document.querySelector('.bar').setAttribute('aria-valuenow', minted);\n  document.getElementById('qty').textContent = qty;\n  document.getElementById('total').textContent = (qty*PRICE+GAS).toFixed(4)+' Ξ';\n  document.getElementById('mintBtn').textContent = 'Mint '+qty+' punk'+(qty>1?'s':'');\n}\nrequestAnimationFrame(()=>setTimeout(renderMint,180));\nrenderMint();\ndocument.getElementById('fill').style.width='0%';\n\ndocument.getElementById('plus').onclick  = ()=>{ qty = Math.min(10, qty+1); renderMint(); };\ndocument.getElementById('minus').onclick = ()=>{ qty = Math.max(1, qty-1); renderMint(); };\n\nconst feed = document.getElementById('liveFeed');\nconst WALLETS = ['0x4a..91bf','glitch.eth','0xd2..77aa','scanline.eth','0x08..3c19','null.eth','0xbe..4d02'];\ndocument.getElementById('mintBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{\n  minted = Math.min(SUPPLY, minted + qty);\n  renderMint();\n  const line = document.createElement('div');\n  line.innerHTML = `<span>you</span> minted <b>${qty} punk${qty>1?'s':''}</b> · just now`;\n  feed.prepend(line);\n  while(feed.children.length>4) feed.lastElementChild.remove();\n  document.querySelectorAll('.art').forEach(a=>{\n    a.classList.add('live'); setTimeout(()=>{ if(!a.closest('.card')||a.closest('.card').dataset.tier!=='glitched'){ if(a.id!=='heroArt') a.classList.remove('live'); } },900);\n  });\n});\n\n/* ambient live feed */\nsetInterval(()=>{\n  if(minted>=SUPPLY) return;\n  const n = 1+Math.floor(Math.random()*3);\n  minted += n; renderMint();\n  const line = document.createElement('div');\n  line.innerHTML = `<span>${WALLETS[Math.floor(Math.random()*WALLETS.length)]}</span> minted <b>${n} punk${n>1?'s':''}</b> · just now`;\n  feed.prepend(line);\n  while(feed.children.length>4) feed.lastElementChild.remove();\n}, 9000);\n\ndocument.getElementById('connect').addEventListener('click', function(){\n  this.textContent = '0xA9…4F2B';\n  this.classList.remove('blue');\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "at": 1790349600257}]}